hadiths[2]{hadithnumber,text}:
"468","[AI-translation] 93 - Yaliyokuja kuhusu nura. 469 - Ametuhadithia Abu Kamil al-Fudhayl bin al-Husayn al-Jahdari, ametuhadithia 'Abd al-Wahid, ametuhadithia Salih bin Salih; ametuhadithia Abu Ma'shar: Kwamba mtu alimpaka nura Mtume wa Allah (Swalla Allahu 'alayhi wa sallam); alipofika sehemu ya siri, yule mtu akajizuia; Mtume wa Allah (Swalla Allahu 'alayhi wa sallam) akajipaka nafsi yake."
"469","[AI-translation] 470 - Ametuhadithia 'Abdullah bin Muhammad bin Ishaq al-Adhrami, ametuhadithia 'Abd al-Wahhab yaani Ibn 'Ata', kutoka kwa Sa'id, kutoka kwa Qatada: Kwamba Nabii (Swalla Allahu 'alayhi wa sallam) hakujipaka nura, wala Abu Bakr, wala 'Umar, wala 'Uthman."
